  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "On a nameless Southern Border mountain, Xiao Mang has driven Xiao Shan near death. Two rank five demonic path Gu Masters descend and save him. The tall and fat one is Sun Pang Hu. After Xiao Mang retreats, Sun Pang Hu looks at Xiao Shan with tears and says they meet again. He says Xiao Shan once saved his life, that his life belongs to brother Xiao, and that he will not leave. With Zhou Xing Xing he swears brotherhood by chicken blood wine and Gu oath, then joins Xiao Shan in founding a fortified village on the mountain.",
      "chapters": [
        963
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "reg_southern_border",
        "char_xiao_mang",
        "char_xiao_shan",
        "fac_gu_masters",
        "char_xiao_yan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "When Yi Tian Village forms and ranks by strength, Xiao Shan takes first place. His sworn brothers Sun Pang Hu and Zhou Xing Xing take second and third as the other rank five experts.",
      "chapters": [
        964
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "yi-tian-village-ranks",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_yi_tian_village"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Xiao Shan, Zhou Xing Xing, and Sun Pang Hu create Yi Tian Village just after Xiao Shan is forced from his clan.",
      "chapters": [
        998
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "yi-tian-village-ranks",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "In later waves of the righteous and demonic fight on Yi Tian Mountain, Xiao Shan, Sun Pang Hu, and Zhou Xing Xing attack on the surface while Lu Zuan Feng is sent to sneak toward the rear. By then Sun Pang Hu and Zhou Xing Xing have already been squeezed to fourth and fifth place.",
      "chapters": [
        966
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "battle-waves",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_yi_tian_mountain",
        "char_lu_zuan_feng"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "On Yi Tian Mountain, a rank four clan leader names Xiao Shan strongest, with Sun Pang Hu and Zhou Xing Xing below him as two demonic path Gu Masters, all three rank five. When Xiao Shan, Sun Pang Hu, and Zhou Xing Xing are forced into a desperate situation, the three attack the righteous path together. That night, in a cave, after Xiao Shan kills a Gu Master who calls for retreat, Sun Pang Hu and Zhou Xing Xing stand up and flank him with wary expressions toward the crowd.",
      "chapters": [
        999
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "rank-five-trio",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_gu_master"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "When Xiao Shan, Lu Zuan Feng, and another rank five Gu Master break into a medical ward hunting spies, Sun Pang Hu walks toward Fang Yuan with a ruthless expression. He shouts that he does not care whether Fang Yuan is a righteous path spy, pounces, and kicks Fang Yuan’s chest so the chest caves and the heart is crushed. His punch then sends Fang Yuan flying into a wall in an appearance of death. Fang Yuan is not dead; the death is a familiar face disguise.",
      "chapters": [
        1002
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "medical-ward-kill",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fang_yuan"
      ]
    }
  ],
